# native.range.4: a quotient by a constant that is only compared with constants is compared through its
# dividend. Every ordering, with bounds the rule takes (K >= 1, or K >= 0 for <= and >) and ones it leaves
# (K below that), counted over dividends on both sides of zero and of each boundary.

fn span(c int) int
    if c > 1000
        return 600000
    40

